\vspace{0.2cm}
\begin{center}
\bf{\Large{CERTIFICATE}}
\end{center}
\vspace{0.02cm}
\par
I hereby certify that the work which is being presented in the M.Tech. Dissertation entitled {\bf ``Design and Performance Analysis of LDPC Codes in Different Wireless Scenario''}, in partial fulfillment of the requirements for the award of the {\bf Master of Technology} in {\bf Communication Systems \& Networks} and submitted to the Department of Electronics \& Communication Engineering of National Institute of Technology, Hamirpur HP, is an authentic record of my own work carried out during a period from July  2010 to July 2011 under the supervision of {\bf Mr.~Rakesh~Sharma, Ass't. Professor}, Department of E\&CE.

The matter presented in this thesis has not been submitted by me for the award of any other degree elsewhere.
